               <p><strong>Payload Analysis Complete!</strong> Instruments are the scientific reason for launching space missions.</p>
               <div class="tut-bullets">
                  <b>Instrument Trade-Offs:</b>
                  <ul>
                     <li><strong>Mass vs. Thrust:</strong> Heavy instruments consume mass, requiring higher motor impulse.</li>
