               </div>
            `;
         } else if (taskNum === 5) {
            titleEl.textContent = 'Task 5 – Mission Control Complete';
            bodyEl.innerHTML = `
               <p><strong>Flight Operations Verified!</strong> Mission Control coordinates the flight sequence from briefing to orbital debrief.</p>
               <div class="tut-bullets">
                  <b>Operations Overview:</b>
                  <ul>
                     <li>Receive your contract target altitude and budget ceilings.</li>
                     <li>Track real-time trajectory curves and telemetry readouts.</li>
                     <li>Return here after successful launches to collect debrief rewards and certification.</li>
                  </ul>
               </div>
            `;
         } else if (taskNum === 6) {
            titleEl.textContent = 'Task 6 – Resource Systems Complete';
            bodyEl.innerHTML = `
               <p><strong>Financial & Vehicle Engineering Understood!</strong></p>
               <div class="tut-bullets">
                  <b>Resource Architecture:</b>
                  <ul>
                     <li><strong style="color:#4fe3d4">Grant Credits (₡):</strong> Operational budget to purchase motors and scientific instruments.</li>
                     <li><strong style="color:#ffd700">Star Credits (★):</strong> Progression currency for major career achievements.</li>
                     <li><strong>Rocket Manifest:</strong> Balance payload mass against engine impulse to reach designated target altitudes.</li>
                  </ul>
               </div>
            `;
         }

         modal.style.display = 'grid';
         continueBtn.onclick = () => {
            modal.style.display = 'none';
            if (tutStep < 6) {
               tutStep++;
               updateTrainingHUD();
            } else {
               // Complete all training!
               finishAllCadetTraining();
            }
         };
      }

      function showComponentExplorerModal() {
         const modal = $('tut-modal');
         const titleEl = $('tut-modal-title');
         const bodyEl = $('tut-modal-body');
         const continueBtn = $('tut-modal-continue-btn');

         titleEl.textContent = 'Task 3 – Spacecraft Assembly Architecture';
         bodyEl.innerHTML = `
            <p>Every spacecraft is assembled from four essential modular subsystems. Click each component below to inspect its role:</p>
            <div class="comp-grid">
               <div class="comp-card" id="comp-1" onclick="inspectComp(1)">
                  <div class="c-title">1. Bus & Frame <span id="ck-1">○</span></div>
                  <div class="c-desc">Structural chassis that withstands extreme vibrational loads during launch.</div>
               </div>
               <div class="comp-card" id="comp-2" onclick="inspectComp(2)">
